# M2 gate: every deterministic scalar arch test of the old core's default suite,
# lockstep on W2 against the golden checkpoints. Interrupt, timer and
# microarchitecture-dependent tests are pass/fail only and are not listed here.
# Format: <suite>/<name> [budget=<cycles>] [hex=<path>] [tohost=<word index>]

